Bones can't be left on that floor, you/re right.  You must have been a
deserted temple.

When in a temple with no priest, occaisionally the game will print that
message and send in a ghost.  (Note that a temple is not just a room
with an altar in it, it has special status in the game.)  The ghost
will carry a name that could be drawn from internal sources, or from
your log file.  It could even have your own character's name, I
believe.

Bones can be left on random quest levels, I think.

